### fetch my profile

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{jabir}}


### update my profile

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{john}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jabir Al Imran",
  "profession": "teacher"
}


